### 1. 회원 등록
POST http://localhost/member/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user",
  "pw": "user@pass",
  "name": "일반유저",
  "phone": "010-1234-1234"
}

### 2. 로그인
POST http://localhost/member/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "user",
  "pw": "user@pass"
}


