### 4. 리스트
GET http://localhost/board/list/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}



### 5. 상세보기
GET http://localhost/board/detail/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}


### 6. 삭제
GET http://localhost/board/delete/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
